// Deploy config for `wrangler deploy` (Cloudflare Workers static assets).
//
// This file must exist even though every value in it is a default-looking one.
// Without a wrangler config, `wrangler deploy` falls back to auto-detection,
// which parses vite.config.js looking for @cloudflare/vite-plugin and dies with
// "Error parsing file" -- this is not a Workers-plugin project, it is a plain
// static build. An explicit config skips detection entirely.
//
// `not_found_handling` is what routes unmatched paths to public/404.html. Note
// that it must stay "404-page" and never "single-page-application": a missing
// asset must 404, not silently render the editor.
//
// public/_headers still applies -- Workers static assets parses it the same way
// Pages does, and does not serve it. That is what ships the CSP.
{
  "name": "tinygames",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-09-11",
  "assets": {
    "directory": "./dist",
    "not_found_handling": "404-page"
  }
}
